交后，把 FULL_COMMIT_SHA 换成完整提交号，运行以下 CLI 显式交付：\n'/opt/homebrew/Cellar/node/26.5.0/bin/node' '/private/tmp/t81-xgqkeq72/candidate/workbench/src/gates/cli.ts' '--state' '/private/tmp/q76-2e01whd7/c-z8a1bhc6/state' 'submit' '--task' 'fixture-20261014-1' '--attempt' '2198e17b-69a4-4c1a-bd1f-0aa4f72928ec' '--session' '35cb5856-32c7-49e0-a001-d838c296d160' '--fence' '1' '--spec-rev' '1' '--commit' 'FULL_COMMIT_SHA'\n本会话的 CLI 会将 submit、status、issue 请求写到 A2A_REQUEST_DIR 指向的本 attempt 专用 /tmp 目录；不直接连接 socket。queued=true 只表示已排队，不是门禁通过。最后结束回合，让 Stop hook 读取并转交；没有请求文件就不交付。请求文件不得进入 Git 提交。查状态用同一入口 status --task，问题上报用 issue --task --title --body。不要修改合同、验收程序或沙箱权限。"}},{"seq":27,"time":"2026-10-14T20:32:12.450Z","task":"fixture-20261014-1","attempt":"2198e17b-69a4-4c1a-bd1f-0aa4f72928ec","type":"dispatched","details":{"attempt":{"task_id":"fixture-20261014-1","attempt_id":"2198e17b-69a4-4c1a-bd1f-0aa4f72928ec","session_id":"35cb5856-32c7-49e0-a001-d838c296d160","fence":1,"spec_rev":1,"thread_id":"6db9d750-485c-4031-a26c-a580a5c710b1","runtime_mode":"workspace-write","turn_id":null,"runtime_identity":{"launch":"4b4daf88-875b-4577-b9ff-b4663a7fa91c","thread":"6db9d750-485c-4031-a26c-a580a5c710b1","shell_pid":31000,"leader_pid":31001,"native_session":"fixture-native-4b4daf88-875b-4577-b9ff-b4663a7fa91c"},"workspace":"/private/tmp/q76-2e01whd7/c-z8a1bhc6/state/worktrees/fixture/fixture-20261014-1-a1","base_commit":"d8e3a88d1ab0de0233f48b6123d53a1babda411b","card_snapshot_id":"ead35182-f471-4697-ad72-f98be33083b4","reclaimed":false,"owner":"fixture-20261014-1","state":"claimed"}}},{"seq":28,"time":"2026-10-14T20:32:13.660Z","task":"fixture-20261014-1","attempt":"2198e17b-69a4-4c1a-bd1f-0aa4f72928ec","type":"command_intent","details":{"argv":["git","-C","/private/tmp/q76-2e01whd7/c-z8a1bhc6/repo","cat-file","-t","77cc4d5d3c48c4ea561895f80207f945aaf3eac5"],"cwd":"/private/tmp/q76-2e01whd7/c-z8a1bhc6/repo"}},{"seq":29,"time":"2026-10-14T20:32:13.666Z","task":"fixture-20261014-1","attempt":"2198